4413377,"text":"あっ、元通りになった。","nextNodeIds":[10230546]},{"nodeId":10230546,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":2823443129,"text":"そろそろ…落ち着かないと。","nextNodeIds":[10230503]},{"nodeId":10230503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":2109593041,"text":"さっきの「魔王武装」は体への負担が大きい。そのせいで考える余裕もなかった…","nextNodeIds":[10230504]},{"nodeId":10230504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":2846457585,"text":"よくよく考えれば、君たちが先に「神の心」を奪う可能性は確かにない。","nextNodeIds":[10230505]},{"nodeId":10230505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":551256553,"text":"「神の心」の件は…君たちと無関係なんだろう。","nextNodeIds":[10230506]},{"nodeId":10230506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4185250529,"text":"そうだ、だから違うって言っただろ！","nextNodeIds":[10230507]},{"nodeId":10230507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":661004729,"text":"旅人、今日君が見せた実力は、モンドで「淑女」が君に下した評価よりもずっと強い。どうしてかな？","nextNodeIds":[10230508,10230509]},{"nodeId":10230508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3055011025,"text":"（7つの元素を集めてるから…）","nextNodeIds":[10230510]},{"nodeId":10230510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3461481729,"text":"その様子じゃ、心当たりはあるんだね？","nextNodeIds":[10230511]},{"nodeId":10230511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":1998003025,"text":"はぁ、俺には言えないか。どうやら、この好奇心は抑えておくしかないようだ。","nextNodeIds":[10230512]},{"nodeId":10230512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":2044128097,"text":"君との戦いはとても良かったよ。","nextNodeIds":[10230513]},{"nodeId":10230513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":2543602065,"text":"俺にとって強さを追求する者はみんな理解し合う友だ、まあ友情の形はやり合うことになるけど…","nextNodeIds":[10230514]},{"nodeId":10230514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2252309241,"text":"変わった価値観だな。","nextNodeIds":[10230515]},{"nodeId":10230515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":811882025,"text":"さて、今はそんな世間話は一旦置いて、任務に戻らないと。","nextNodeIds":[10230516]},{"nodeId":10230516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":308235873,"text":"——「神の心」がここにないのなら…最初から「仙祖の亡骸」の中には存在しないのか？","nextNodeIds":[10230517]},{"nodeId":10230517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3257304041,"text":"というより、「仙祖の亡骸」自体、目をくらます手段かもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[10230518]},{"nodeId":10230518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3242884137,"text":"うん？それって…","nextNodeIds":[10230519,10230520]},{"nodeId":10230519,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3804478057,"text":"岩王帝君は死んでない？","nextNodeIds":[10230521]},{"nodeId":10230521,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3337586273,"text":"おそらくね。それが本当なら…面白い。","nextNodeIds":[10230522]},{"nodeId":10230522,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":2063023177,"text":"さすが商業の都の守護神、「契約以外の小細工」にも詳しいんだな。","nextNodeIds":[10230523]},{"nodeId":10230523,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":1601229849,"text":"となると、「予備プラン」を使うしかない。","nextNodeIds":[10230524]},{"nodeId":10230524,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3926430217,"text":"予備プラン？","nextNodeIds":[10230525]},{"nodeId":10230525,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3793482961,"text":"弱者に影響を及ぼすから、本来だったら使いたくないんだけど。","nextNodeIds":[10230526]},{"nodeId":10230526,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3870101585,"text":"所詮、この世界は強さを追求する者のためにあるからね。弱者を気にしている余裕なんてない。","nextNodeIds":[10230527]},{"nodeId":10230527,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":1765476609,"text":"それにファトゥスは「手段」を選ばない。子供だって嫌いなものを食べなきゃいけない時があるだろ。","nextNodeIds":[10230528]},{"nodeId":10230528,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1486031305,"text":"それで…一体なにをするつもりだ？","nextNodeIds":[10230529]},{"nodeId":10230529,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3187375241,"text":"「孤雲閣」の下で眠る魔神を呼び覚ます。","nextNodeIds":[10230530]},{"nodeId":10230530,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2989710801,"text":"魔神！？","nextNodeIds":[10230531]},{"nodeId":10230531,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":1940737945,"text":"<color=#00E1FFFF>「渦の魔神」、オセル</color>。魔神戦争で「岩の魔神」モラクスに敗れ、海中に封印されてる。","nextNodeIds":[10230532]},{"nodeId":10230532,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":862146489,"text":"そんな魔神が、神のいない璃月港を襲ったら…","nextNodeIds":[10230533]},{"nodeId":10230533,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":864227905,"text":"俺たちをさんざん弄んだ岩王帝君様も、これ以上見て見ぬふりはできないだろうね？","nextNodeIds":[10230534]},{"nodeId":10230534,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2167662689,"text":"…で、でも、魔神戦争は2000年前に終わったんだぞ！七神しかいない今、昔の魔神をどう…","nextNodeIds":[10230535]},{"nodeId":10230535,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":219757945,"text":"「呼び覚ます」手段があるに決まってるだろ。","nextNodeIds":[10230536]},{"nodeId":10230536,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1218455177,"text":"あーっ！「禁忌滅却の札」！","nextNodeIds":[10230537]},{"nodeId":10230537,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3199435721,"text":"お、思い出したぞ！「ファデュイ」がそれを研究してるって…","nextNodeIds":[10230538,10230539]},{"nodeId":10230538,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3162335049,"text":"研究場にも行った。","nextNodeIds":[10230540]},{"nodeId":10230540,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":1787911265,"text":"その通り、君たちに渡したのは、この研究の副産物だよ。","nextNodeIds":[10230541]},{"nodeId":10230541,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":1574916577,"text":"これほどの力を持つ「禁忌滅却の札」に、女皇がくれた「執行官」の力…岩の槍による封印を一時的に解除するのも、できなくはないだろうね。","nextNodeIds":[10230544]},{"nodeId":10230544,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":149013761,"text":"俺にとって、上古魔神の力を使うこと自体面白くないし、俺の信条にも欠けるけど…","nextNodeIds":[10230545]},{"nodeId":10230545,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10200,"speakerName":"「公子」","textMapHash":3777725337,"text":"あの岩神だけでなく、君たちまで動かないといけなくなるって考えると…それなりに面白い。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":10230539,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2453732609,"text":"本物を「コピー」しようとした。","nextNodeIds":[10230540]},{"nodeId":10230520,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2964746721,"text":"亡骸は偽物だってこと？","nextNodeIds":[10230521]},{"nodeId":10230509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1543574353,"text":"（かつての力が戻りつつあるから…）","nextNodeIds":[10230510]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[102305,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FAIL_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["10009","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","183"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_LOCK_POINT"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":